    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="37.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 37.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he hit butan his gewitnesse do, geselle se þe hine to men feormie CXX scill to wite: dæle he hwæðre ðæt, healf cyninge in ða scire ðe he ǽr folgode, healf in þa ðe he oncymð.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he does it without his knowledge, let him who took him on as his man pay 120 shillings as fine: however, he should divide that, half to the [lord] in the shire he belonged to before and half to [the lord] in that [shire] where he has arrived.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If he does so without his cognisance, he who takes him into his emploment shall pay a fine of 120 shillings; but he shall divide the payment, [paying] half to the king in the district where the man has been residing, and half in that to which he has come.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he hit buton his gewitnesse dó, gesylle se þe hyne to men feormige CXX scll' to wite: dæle he þæt hweðre, healf (þam) cyninge on ða scire ðe he ær folgode, [⁊] healf on ða ðe he (þonne) oncymð.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
